    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d818">

                <pb facs="1193" n="1179" sameAs="frus:frus1947v05/pg1179"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/10–1147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Syria</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Memminger</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Damascus</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-11T13:00:00+02:00">October 11, 1947—1
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>325. Syrian army units from Horns, Hama, Aleppo as well as Damascus moving slowly
                    orderly to Palestine frontier today. (Reference Legation’s telegram 323, October
                        10<anchor n="1" xml:id="d818-f1"/>). Visit Damascus area camps this morning
                    revealed loaded convoys and men awaiting march order.</p>
                <p>Damascus press predicts early declaration independent Palestine [and] formation
                    Arab Government under presidency Grand Mufti; <pb facs="1194" n="1180"
                        xml:id="pg1180"/> claims this decision taken in addition those published
                    League’s formal communiqué.</p>
                <p>Sent Department as 325, repeated Beirut 14, Baghdad 36, London 17.</p>
                <p>Department please pass Jerusalem.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memminger</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
